    "status": "present",
    "value": "Count positive integers at most n containing at least one repeated decimal digit. The approach is: subtract positive unique-digit counts from n using permutation suffix counts and a bounded prefix. Its target cost is O(d*10) time/O(10) space for d<=10. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
